OL,3,GNEWSALate night tax on clubs and pubs
OL,4,Aset to be axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charge on a city's pubs, bars, and
OL,7,Fclubs that funds safety measures looks
OL,8,Fset to be abolished following a key
OL,9,Fmeeting.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council's licencing
OL,12,Fcommittee agreed the late night levy
OL,13,Fshould be scrapped during a meeting on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FIt means a consultation must now take
OL,17,Fplace, with the Lib-Dem council
OL,18,Fexpected to make a final decision in
OL,19,FOctober at a full council meeting.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
