OL,3,GNEWSALate night tax on clubs and pubs
OL,4,Aset to be axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe levy is an annual fee of between
OL,7,F#299 and #4,400, currently charged to
OL,8,F281 businesses in the city with a
OL,9,Flicence to sell alcohol between
OL,10,Fmidnight and 06:00.
